meta {
  name: Get Document Status
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{coreBaseUrl}}:8114/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
}

docs {
  functions-core: GetDocumentStatus (port 8114). Returns the caller's own
  most recent DBS document (status, reviewNote if rejected, uploadedAt), or
  {"status": "none"} if they've never uploaded one. Full app spec §4.1 —
  the DBS upload screen needs this for a status badge instead of a bare
  upload button.
}
